When you deploy, you simply tell Azure which parameter file to use:

Azure CLI: 
az deployment group create --resource-group MyRG --template-file azuredeploy.json --parameters @azuredeploy.parameters.json [4.5]

PowerShell: 
New-AzResourceGroupDeployment -ResourceGroupName MyRG -TemplateFile azuredeploy.json -TemplateParameterFile azuredeploy.parameters.json [4.1]